# Hual04c carry-in combat/escort route (UU/seconds), appended to the re-timed prefix.
# Time shifts the prefix's descent so the carried loadout fights from the canyon floor.
# Real SelectWeapon exits the Hook item mode and picks the carried Beretta (group2); the
# north approach selects the carried M16 (group11) to clear the manonhighspotleft sniper.
# No teleports, grants, health writes or control overrides; only the game's own corpse
# QuickHeal medkit is used. The route clears the first encounter (soldier28/29/30), the
# second wave (2/31/32/33) and the BaseSoldier1 high-spot sniper, reaches Carrington, and
# retreats south at 2 HP; the escort then waits on the northern kill event (see the test).
t=84.00 select_weapon 2
t=86.00 select_weapon 2
